# Recorded board -> host handshake trace (Firmata 2.5, StandardFirmata).
# Frame 1: REPORT_VERSION 0xF9 major=2 minor=5.
# Frame 2: REPORT_FIRMWARE sysex 0xF0 0x79 major=2 minor=5,
#          name "StandardFirmata" as 2 x 7-bit characters, 0xF7.
# Source: byte layouts from firmata/protocol protocol.md and the firmware
# report decoder in firmata.js (see PROVENANCE.md sec. 2).
f9 02 05
f0 79 02 05 53 00 74 00 61 00 6e 00 64 00 61 00 72 00 64 00 46 00 69 00 72 00 6d 00 61 00 74 00 61 00 f7
